 "design": "Both classes REAL. label 0 = high en.wikipedia pageviews (the model plausibly learned it), label 1 = low pageviews drawn from the SAME Wikipedia category (it plausibly did not). Matched inside the pair on category, last-word initial and name length. Five domains: book 40, firm 32, painting 10, person 40, place 40 pairs.",
